    {
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Black-box parity probe between the `nucleide.tritium` 1D diffusion-trapping kernel and FESTIM 2.1 (Apache-2.0, `festim==2.1`, v2.x API), driven in the probe-only digest-pinned DOLFINx image (docker; never the main validation container, never the Rust workspace). Progression F1 trap-free Dirichlet-Dirichlet, F2 one McNabb-Foster trap, F3 Sieverts ends, F4 two-layer stack; F5 independently refined trap-free recombination outlet. Always-run legs VV Val-1da (analytic permeation) and M1 (manufactured-solution order) gate the Nucleide side everywhere; every FESTIM leg SKIPs loudly with its reason outside the probe image."
    },
